==={{TMC|-}}===
{{Descriptions TMC}}
Crows appear in the [[Western Wood]] in {{TMC}}, perching on [[Tree]]s. They will swoop down and attempt to strike Link. [[Takkuri]] appear  as a red variant of Crows that can steal [[Rupee]]s.

==={{PH|-}}===
Crows will swoop down and attack Link in an attempt to steal [[Rupee]]s from him in {{PH}}.

==={{ST|-}}===
Crows will also swoop down and attack Link to steal his [[Rupee]]s in {{ST}}.

==={{ALBW|-}}===
{{Stub|ALBW}}
Crows reappear in {{ALBW}}, where they act the same as in ALttP. They also appear in the [[Octoball Derby]] minigame where they appear after 3 consecutive hits and award 20 points when hit.

