==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Main|Mountain Crow}}
{{Compendium/Extract|Mountain Crow}}
Crows appear in {{BotW}} by the name of [[Mountain Crow]]s. They are passive [[Creature]]s instead of [[Enemy|Enemies]]. If approached by Link, they will simply fly off instead of bothering or attacking him. They drop [[Raw Bird Drumstick]]s when killed.

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Main|Mountain Crow}}
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Mountain Crow}}
As in {{BotW}}, Mountain Crows are docile [[Creature]]s that are quick to flee. They will drop [[Raw Bird Drumstick]]s if they die.

